<title>USA: U.S. soybean inspection destinations - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soybean inspection destinations - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 8.813 million bushels of U.S. soybeans inspected for export in the week ended Sept 12 were for the following destinations (1,000 bushels):</p>
<p>Duluth-Superior to Canada 823.</p>
<p>Mississippi River to Taiwan 1,516; Germany 1,247; Japan 2,038; South Korea 708; Netherlands 1,707.</p>
<p>Interior to Mexico 774.</p>
